%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented)
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant P as Product agent
  participant R as Retriever
  participant DB as Postgres and pgvector
  participant EM as Embedding provider
  participant L as LLM
  participant RV as Response validator
  O->>P: Product question, redacted query
  P->>R: Search with product and audience filters
  R->>EM: Embed redacted query
  EM-->>R: Query vector
  par Vector search
    R->>DB: pgvector search, status approved and in effect
  and Keyword search
    R->>DB: Full-text search, status approved and in effect
  end
  DB-->>R: Candidates with metadata
  R->>R: Merge by reciprocal rank, apply relevance threshold
  alt Evidence sufficient
    R-->>P: Chunks marked as untrusted data, version IDs
    P->>L: Instructions, delimited evidence, question
    L-->>P: Answer with chunk references
    P->>RV: Answer and evidence
    alt Grounded
      RV->>DB: Record citations with document versions
      RV-->>O: Passed
    else Unsupported claim
      RV-->>O: Blocked, approved fallback
    end
  else Evidence insufficient
    R-->>P: No authoritative evidence
    P-->>O: Approved limitation message, offer human support
  end
